</p><div class="sketch-full"><a class="photoswipe" href="https://sketches.sachachua.com/filename/2026-11-01-04%20Life%20as%20a%2042-year-old%20&#45;&#45;%20annual%20review.jpeg" data-src="https://sketches.sachachua.com/static/2026-11-01-04%20Life%20as%20a%2042-year-old%20&#45;&#45;%20annual%20review.jpeg" data-title="2026-11-01-04 Life as a 42-year-old &#45;&#45; annual review.jpeg" data-w="2900" data-h="2050"><picture>
