<p>
It's almost a straightforward shift from childcare to productive time, which is mostly Emacs, and a little bit more personal care time rather than playing.
My evenings and weekends still feel mostly focused on childcare.
It's just that I have more weekday time for my own things.
I've also been able to wake up earlier for things like sessions with my French tutor or Emacs Chats with other people.
</p>
